<title>HUNGARY: Skala-Coop 's profit falls in 1996.</title>
<headline>Skala-Coop 's profit falls in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending december 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996		1995</p>
<p>    Group operating result		516.7     vs    741.9</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result		  384.1     vs    664.2</p>
<p>    Group after-tax result		339.9     vs    618.2</p>
<p>    Group sales			  11,552.9     vs  9,861.0</p>
<p>    Group other revenues		  486.8     vs    971.4</p>
<p>    Group material expenditures    8,199.8     vs  6,931.8</p>
<p>    Group personnel expenditures   1,508.7     vs  1,360.6</p>
<p>    Group depreciation		   356.2     vs    341.7</p>
<p>    Group other costs		    751.0     vs    625.7</p>
<p>    Group other expenditures	   712.8     vs    838.1</p>
<p>    Group financial operations	143.8 Loss vs    64.5 loss</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary revenues     163.2     vs    840.1</p>
<p>Group extraordinary</p>
<p>	expenditures			 151.9     vs    853.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Skala-Coop Rt is a holding company. The figures are consolidated and the 1996 figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
